      <uighur>damnal</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дамнал</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DAMNAL</transcript>
      <definition>1 [= damnalγ-a] n. Doubt, indecision, irresolution, hesitation; uncertainty; mistrust.</definition>
      <page>228</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠮᠨᠠᠯ ᠲᠠᠰᠤᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tasulxu</transcript>
          <definition> To resolve a doubt.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠮᠨᠠᠯ ᠲᠥᠷᠦᠭᠦᠯᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tørygylky</transcript>
          <definition> To arouse doubt or suspicion.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠮᠨᠠᠯ ᠲᠥᠷᠦᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tøryky</transcript>
          <definition> For a doubt to arise; to doubt.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠮᠨᠠᠯ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei</transcript>
          <definition> Without doubt, doubtless.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
